# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the Python version is individual.
#   For an application or a deployment, you might want to check them in.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in cases where the lock file is platform-dependent, it can be excluded.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Poetry uses poetry.lock to ensure reproducible builds. It's recommended to commit this file.
#   https://python-poetry.org
#poetry.lock

